# Recorded input for the combo box example page (widgets/combobox.zig, `Example`), at 800 x 600
# in the default theme: the box at x 58..218, y 8..42; its open list at x 58..218,
# y 48..172: Apple (y 51..81), Apricot (81..110), Banana, Cherry, x 61..215; filtered to Banana
# alone, Banana is at y 51..81.
# One line per frame says what it does (format: input.Replay). Keys are USB HID: 81 Down,
# 40 Enter, 41 Escape.
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 800 600
dt 0.016
pointer 400 300
# 1: press the box: it takes the keyboard
frame
pointer 138 25
buttons left
# 2: release: the list opens, all four options shown
frame
buttons
# 3: type "ap": Apple and Apricot shown
frame
text ap
# 4: Down: Apple
frame
press 81
# 5: Down: Apricot
frame
press 81
# 6: Enter: Apricot chosen, the list closes
frame
press 40
# 7: Escape with the list closed: the text cleared
frame
press 41
# 8: type "b": Banana shown
frame
text b
# 9: the pointer reaches Banana
frame
pointer 138 66
# 10: press it
frame
buttons left
# 11: release: Banana chosen
frame
buttons
# 12: press elsewhere: the box gives up the keyboard
frame
pointer 700 500
buttons left
# 13: release
frame
buttons
